      "statement": "A wsl launcher profile calls wsl.exe internally with bash -ilc (login + interactive) specifically so ~/.bashrc entries such as nvm/pnpm/cargo PATH setup are fully loaded before the Linux-side many-ai-cli binary runs, opens the Windows browser as soon as the Linux side prints the Hub URL, and automatically picks the next available port on a Windows-side collision.",
