      "statement": "cmd/many-ai-cli-launcher/main.go's own doc comment states that running with no flags (the plain double-click / direct invocation case) always opens a browser-based profile-selection page on a random loopback port, on which already-connected profiles are marked; connecting without that picker requires an explicit --profile or --last flag.",
