    {
      "id": "claim_e518714bb0984886b6f40b2e60bfd134",
      "statement": "The launcher's SSH connections run ssh.exe with -o BatchMode=yes so a password prompt fails immediately rather than falling back to interactive entry, meaning key-based authentication is mandatory; passwords and key passphrases are never saved by the launcher, SSH forwarding is 127.0.0.1-to-127.0.0.1 local forward only with no -g/GatewayPorts, and a token obtained via a tunnel profile's token_command is used only for the current session's connection and is never written into launcher-profiles.yaml.",
